@startuml AI Assistant Query Sequence Diagram
title Figure X: AI Assistant Query Lifecycle Sequence Diagram

' Professional Sequence Diagram Styling
skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 40
skinparam BoxPadding 10

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #0078d4
    LifeLineBorderColor #0078d4
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #f0f7ff
    
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #f0f7ff
    ParticipantBorderColor #0078d4
    ParticipantFontSize 14
    ParticipantFontColor #0078d4
    
    ActorBackgroundColor #f0f7ff
    ActorBorderColor #0078d4
}

skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #fff9e6
    BorderColor #d4a017
    FontSize 11
}

actor "Plant Operator" as User
participant "AIChatAssistant" as UI <<Boundary>>
participant "AssistantService" as Service <<Control>>
participant "DashboardContext" as Context <<System>>
participant "LLM (OpenRouter/AI)" as LLM <<External Service>>
database "IndexedDB" as DB <<Database>>

autonumber

User -> UI : Submit Query (e.g., "Explain efficiency drop")
activate UI

UI -> UI : Add User Message to State
UI -> Service : sendAssistantMessage(question, conversation)
activate Service

Service -> Context : getDashboardContext()
activate Context
note over Context : Aggregates Live Weather,\nOptimization Inputs,\nand Last Recommendation.
Context --> Service : Normalized context JSON
deactivate Context

Service -> LLM : POST /api/assistant (Enriched Payload)
activate LLM
note right of Service : Payload = { question, context, history, model }
LLM --> Service : JSON { reply, chart, suggestedTitle }
deactivate LLM

Service --> UI : Response Object
deactivate Service

UI -> UI : Process & Normalize Charts
UI -> DB : saveAssistantThread(updatedThread)
activate DB
DB --> UI : Success
deactivate DB

UI --> User : Display AI Reply & Visual Charts
deactivate UI

@enduml
